[{"title":"天冠山二十八首 其十八 风洞","author":"王士熙","text":"清风贮深洞，四时长氤氲。\n飘然无遽发，散我山中云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27559,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天冠山二十八首 其十九 石人峰","author":"王士熙","text":"仙人立危峰，欲作凌云举。\n飘然阅浮世，独立寂无语。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27560,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天冠山二十八首 其二十 学堂岩","author":"王士熙","text":"仙人读书处，樵子闻时声。\n犹胜烂柯者，只看棋一枰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27561,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天冠山二十八首 其二十一 凤山","author":"王士熙","text":"孤凤栖山中，白云护清境。\n朝阳早飞来，月落空岩冷。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27562,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天冠山二十八首 其二十二 馨香岩","author":"王士熙","text":"蛟涎渍顽石，磴道何崎岖。\n深潭湛古色，兴云只须臾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27563,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天冠山二十八首 其二十三 钓台","author":"王士熙","text":"地非七里滩，名乃千古同。\n神仙聊戏剧，何有一丝风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27564,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天冠山二十八首 其二十四 砌潭","author":"王士熙","text":"山川万古秘，云雨一潭幽。\n何日卧龙起，碧潭空自秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27565,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天冠山二十八首 其二十五 三山石","author":"王士熙","text":"三山岂仙居，百世真道学。\n荒台明月秋，怀哉彼先觉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27566,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天冠山二十八首 其二十六 五面石","author":"王士熙","text":"奇石不为峰，何用作五面。\n独立赏春晖，水流花片片。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27567,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天冠山二十八首 其二十七 小隐岩","author":"王士熙","text":"抽矢射白额，归洞读旧书。\n小隐不可见，后来谁卜居。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27568,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天冠山二十八首 其二十八 一线天","author":"王士熙","text":"青天何荡荡，此中才一线。\n大道本来明，慎勿安所见。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27569,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李宫人琵琶引九首 其四","author":"王士熙","text":"紫檀别殿锁春光，铃索声閒白日长。\n不似开元教坊曲，太真微醉拨龙香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27570,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李宫人琵琶引九首 其五","author":"王士熙","text":"一入深宫岁月长，承恩曾得侍昭阳。\n檀槽按出新翻曲，五色云中落凤凰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27571,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李宫人琵琶引九首 其七","author":"王士熙","text":"瑶池高宴奏清商，偷得蟠桃带露尝。\n莫道仙凡便成隔，时时青鸟向人翔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27572,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李宫人琵琶引九首 其八","author":"王士熙","text":"贱妾霞宫母在堂，当年云鬓共苍苍。\n太平传得梨园谱，似说春风梦一场。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27573,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李宫人琵琶引九首 其九","author":"王士熙","text":"剑舞当年识大娘，花奴羯鼓漫悲伤。\n贞元朝士仍多在，应笑青衫泣白郎。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27574,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词十首 其一","author":"王士熙","text":"居庸山前涧水多，白榆林下石坡陀。\n后来才度枪竿岭，前车昨日到滦河。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27575,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词十首 其二","author":"王士熙","text":"宫装騕袅锦障泥，百两毡车一字齐。\n夜宿岩前觅泉水，林中还有子规啼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27576,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词十首 其三","author":"王士熙","text":"新雨霏霏绿罽匀，马蹄何处有沙尘？\n阿谁能剪山前草，赠与佳人作舞茵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27577,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词十首 其四","author":"王士熙","text":"车帘都卷锦流苏，自控金鞍撚仆姑。\n草间白雀能言语，莫学江南唱鹧鸪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27578,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词十首 其五","author":"王士熙","text":"山前马陈烂如云，九夏如秋不是春。\n昨夜玄冥剪飞雪，云州山里尽堆银。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27579,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词十首 其六","author":"王士熙","text":"山上去采芍药花，山前来寻地椒芽。\n土屋青帘留买酒，石泉老衲唤供茶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27580,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词十首 其七","author":"王士熙","text":"风高白海陇云黄，寒雁来时天路长。\n山上逢山不归去，何人马蹄生得方。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27581,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词十首 其八","author":"王士熙","text":"山前闻说有神龙，百脉流泉灌水舂。\n道与年年往来客，六月惊湍莫得逢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27582,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词十首 其九","author":"王士熙","text":"天上瑶宫是吾居，三年犹恨往来疏。\n滦阳侍臣骑马去，金烛朝天拟献书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27583,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词十首 其十","author":"王士熙","text":"龙冈积翠护新宫，滦水秋波太液风。\n要使《竹枝》传上国，正是皇家四海同。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27584,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上都柳枝词七首 其一","author":"王士熙","text":"曾见上都杨柳枝，龙江女儿好腰肢。\n西锦缠头急催酒，舞到秋来人去时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27585,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上都柳枝词七首 其二","author":"王士熙","text":"惹雪和烟复带霜，小东门外万条长。\n君王夜过五花殿，曾与龙驹系紫缰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27586,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上都柳枝词七首 其三","author":"王士熙","text":"来时垂叶嫩青青，归去西风又飘零。\n愿得侬身长似柳，年年天上作飞星。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27587,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上都柳枝词七首 其四","author":"王士熙","text":"侬在南都见柳花，花红柳绿有人家。\n如今四月犹飞絮，沙碛萧萧映草芽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27588,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上都柳枝词七首 其五","author":"王士熙","text":"雪色骅骝窈窕骑，宫罗窄袖袂能垂。\n驻向山前折杨柳，戏撚柔条作笛吹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27589,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上都柳枝词七首 其六","author":"王士熙","text":"偏岭前头树树逢，轻于苍桧短于松。\n急风卷絮悲游子，永日留阴送去侬。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27590,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上都柳枝词七首 其七","author":"王士熙","text":"合门岭上雪凄凄，小树云深望欲迷。\n何日汶阳寻故里，绿阴阴里听莺啼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27591,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京次李学士韵五首 其一","author":"王士熙","text":"山拥石城月上迟，大安阁前清暑时。\n玉碗争呼传法酒，碧笺时进教坊诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27592,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京次李学士韵五首 其二","author":"王士熙","text":"金烛承恩出院迟，玉堂学士草麻时。\n明朝出国新端午，彩笔应供帖子诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27593,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京次李学士韵五首 其三","author":"王士熙","text":"昼漏浑争一刻迟，玉京六月似秋时。\n箧中日日藏纨扇，说与班娘莫写诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27594,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京次李学士韵五首 其四","author":"王士熙","text":"芍药阑前春信迟，燕京端午石榴时。\n双双紫燕自寻垒，小小白翎能念诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27595,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题扇三首 其一","author":"王士熙","text":"西山云净换新秋，碧树堂深野水流。\n此夜画阑都乞巧，月明何处望牵牛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27596,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题扇三首 其二","author":"王士熙","text":"横波清浅露平洲，沙暖鸳鸯得意游。\n一夜西风吹雨过，有人独上木兰舟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27597,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题扇三首 其三","author":"王士熙","text":"银河秋早露华新，碧树云收月半轮。\n庭外西风闻雁过，画楼应有断肠人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27598,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"太乙宫留题","author":"王士熙","text":"石径松花静掩扉，芙蓉秋早蝶双飞。\n主人何处采芝去，待到日斜犹未归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27599,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次薛玄卿韵","author":"王士熙","text":"石坛秋昼下云旗，铁锁峰前暂别离。\n一夜珠宫新露冷，步虚直到月斜时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27600,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"悼程妻许氏","author":"王士熙","text":"绮窗花雨赆春风，宝镜尘昏杼轴空。\n三粲未笄儿未冠，忍教夫婿叹孤鸿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27601,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"高房山画","author":"王士熙","text":"吴山重叠粉团高，有客晨兴洒墨毫。\n百两真珠难买得，越峰压倒涌金涛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27602,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉题袁伯长开平百首诗后","author":"王士熙","text":"玉海云生贝阙高，骑鲸人去采芝遨。\n滦江一夕秋风到，瑟瑟珊瑚涌翠涛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27603,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题四爱堂四首 其一","author":"王士点","text":"余所爱兮崇兰，植之兮堂间。\n思夫君兮山谷，纫翠佩兮杂青纶。\n兰芳歇兮日在山，欲从之兮不得閒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27604,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题四爱堂四首 其二","author":"王士点","text":"余所爱兮修莲，植之兮堂前。\n思夫君兮濂之水，濯冠缨兮叩渔舷。\n莲馨富兮水泥烟，欲从之兮不我贤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27605,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题四爱堂四首 其三","author":"王士点","text":"余所爱兮秋菊，植之兮堂隩。\n思夫君兮柴桑，巾漉酒兮杯生馥。\n菊英黄兮江波缩，欲从之兮不我复。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27606,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题四爱堂四首 其四","author":"王士点","text":"余所爱兮湘梅，植之兮堂隈。\n思夫君兮浙之湖，吟清浅兮句容裁。\n梅蘖素兮雪飞埃，欲从之兮勿余猜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27607,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟古寄京师诸知己二首 其一","author":"雅琥","text":"中天悬高台，上有仙人家。\n云窗织流月，石磴凌飞霞。\n帘萦翡翠丝，壁粲芙蓉砂。\n群仙恣遨游，青鸾骖羽车。\n左携若木枝，右折蟠桃花。\n斡旋雨露功，吞吐日月华。\n愿苏颠崖氓，天瓢浩无涯。\n草木悉沾濡，遂及蒹与葭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27608,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟古寄京师诸知己二首 其二","author":"雅琥","text":"阆风接玄圃，紫禁连西清。\n扶桑浴朝暾，缥缈见层城。\n海水几万里，谁能计修程？\n东皇司造命，广庭延群英。\n中有三五君，生平想仪刑。\n赓歌谐都俞，论思赞高明。\n菲菲蔼春华，翕如锵凤笙。\n而我抱幽独，几年适蛮荆。\n瘴疠肌肉消，盗贼梦寐惊。\n种种履忧患，谁能念伶仃。\n愿假刀圭妙，白日羽翰生。\n微渺得攀附，相将还帝京。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27609,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题周昉明皇水中射鹿图","author":"雅琥","text":"开元天子奋神武，一矢成功定寰宇。\n飞骑营中堕牝鸡，妖星散落纷如雨。\n迩来校猎渭城东，姚崇发踪指顾中。\n马前十论效驱策，君王已贺获隽功。\n波涛澒洞真龙立，应见波间老蛟泣。\n画师盘礡笔有神，千载英姿如昨日。\n君不见天宝年来事事非，宫中行乐昼游稀。\n可怜野鹿衔花去，犹向樽前按舞衣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27610,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送御史王伯循之南台","author":"雅琥","text":"京华岁晏饶风雪，况复知交远相别。\n金貂贳酒燕市傍，官柳残条未堪折。\n客心恋恋不忍发，离歌莫唱《阳关》叠。\n羡君年少早致身，文章德业追古人。\n绣衣骢马向南去，江湖草木含青春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27611,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"秦淮谣","author":"雅琥","text":"天险淮南纪，犹隔秦淮水。\n水上石头城，城头更戍兵。\n如何爱歌舞，坐待韩擒虎。\n璧月委琼姿，欢娱能几时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27612,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"大堤曲","author":"雅琥","text":"郎家大堤上，妾住横塘曲。\n年少结新欢，离别岂所欲。\n日日望郎归，门前春草绿。\n嫁时双明珠，系妾红罗襦。\n纂制远游履，愿谐比目鱼。\n路长不可致，搔首空踟蹰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27613,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赋得月漉漉送方叔高作尉江南","author":"雅琥","text":"月漉漉，泥在水。\n送君归，几千里。\n泥在水，月不明。\n执君别，难为情。\n漉漉见月，水深泥多。\n飘飘游子，岁暮如何？\n洞庭霜下，木落无波。\n白云在望，鼓枻讴歌。\n念子之来，携书一束。\n兹焉言归，荣养以禄。\n雄剑在匣，弨弓在箙。\n驰骋千里，毋尔局蹙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27614,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鄢陵经进士李伯昭墓","author":"雅琥","text":"激烈山阳笛，凄凉祖逖鞭。\n才高天不惜，命薄世空怜。\n故里一丘土，荒城五亩田。\n虽云有宿草，宁忍不潸然。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27615,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"云溪真馆","author":"雅琥","text":"真馆云溪上，孤高逼太清。\n江山环几席，星斗拂檐楹。\n树古成龙去，篁疏作凤鸣。\n仙游始可接，我欲谢尘缨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27616,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"武夷山","author":"雅琥","text":"笙鹤辽天杪，仙家宴幔亭。\n鲸波一浸碧，蚁垤九烟青。\n洞閟秦人蜕，坛留汉祀星。\n余方有公事，未得叩岩扃。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27617,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和韵王继学题周冰壶四美人图唐宫题叶","author":"雅琥","text":"彩毫将恨付霜红，恨自绵绵水自东。\n金屋有关严虎豹，玉书无路托鳞鸿。\n秋期暗度惊催织，春信潜通误守宫。\n莫道银河消息杳，明年锦树又西风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27618,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"崔徽写真","author":"雅琥","text":"舞鸾妆镜拭铅华，毫素无声散彩霞。\n夜月影寒分桂魄，春冰晕薄映桃花。\n梦随图去凭青鸟，愁逐书来点墨鸦。\n未得离魂如倩女，衰容先我到君家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27619,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"洛神","author":"雅琥","text":"邺宫檐瓦似鸳飘，兰渚鸣鸾去国遥。\n谩说君王留宝枕，不闻仙子和琼箫。\n惊鸿易没青天月，沈鲤难凭碧海潮。\n肠断洛川东去水，野烟汀草共萧萧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27620,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"二乔","author":"雅琥","text":"珊树交加玉树重，鸳鸯难偶雪难容。\n共思汉事随流水，各对吴侬蹙远峰。\n洛赋未成梁月堕，胡笳已断塞云浓。\n人间流落浑相似，犹胜凄凉泣暮蛩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27621,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄南台御史达兼善二首 其一","author":"雅琥","text":"昔年奎壁聚星图，文采虚称二妙俱。\n祇有蒹葭依玉树，初无薏苡似明珠。\n凤凰台上天光近，乌鹊枝边月影孤。\n壮志未消知己在，敢烦音问慰穷途。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27622,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄南台御史达兼善二首 其二","author":"雅琥","text":"白沟秋水帝城边，晓发河南使者船。\n契阔山川将万里，飘零岁月又三年。\n云间快睹冥冥凤，海上愁看跕跕鸢。\n经术匡君须我辈，莫将离恨染华颠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27623,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送苏伯修御史之南台","author":"雅琥","text":"天上词臣夐莫双，乘骢此日莅南邦。\n梅花路近宜逢雪，桃叶波平好渡江。\n千里苍生瞻绣斧，十州使者避旌幢。\n同袍知己如相问，已许閒身老北窗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27624,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"汴梁怀古","author":"雅琥","text":"花石冈前麋鹿过，中原秋色动关河。\n欲询故国伤心事，忍听前朝皓齿歌。\n蔓草有风嘶石马，荆榛无月泣铜驼。\n人间富贵皆如梦，不独兴亡感慨多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27625,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"酬江夏友人见寄","author":"雅琥","text":"四海元龙眼界空，平生豪习竟谁雄。\n早知黔首成秦赘，悔学蛾眉入汉宫。\n曲水疏篁秋色里，小山丛桂月明中。\n故人岁晚能招隐，便买扁舟向汉东。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27626,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送赵秉彝亲迎江夏之官临川","author":"雅琥","text":"婀娜新衣锦绣重，美人今夕过湖东。\n一声铁笛千家月，十幅蒲帆万里风。\n孔雀画屏占贵客，甘棠嘉树咏先公。\n墨池光动凌云笔，春满花封赋更雄。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27627,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送蒙古学教授之邛州","author":"雅琥","text":"玉贯珠联我国音，乱山深处变巴吟。\n苍虬挂屋寒筇瘦，白鹤悬巢古栈深。\n座冷一毡知宦况，书来万里见乡心。\n文翁课最同文盛，应译嘉谟寄上林。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27628,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"二月梅","author":"雅琥","text":"去年呵笔赋寒梅，又见仙家二月开。\n不是东君留客醉，肯教神女逐春回。\n梨花院落为云妒，柳絮池塘作雪猜。\n东阁如今清兴减，罗浮谁与寄香来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":27629,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]